[I] Sophisticated calendar and alarm program

[T] Remind is a sophisticated calendar and alarm program for the command
[T] line. Reminders are written in a flexible scripting language supporting
[T] recurring events, holidays and date calculations, and Remind can display
[T] them as text, PostScript or HTML calendars and trigger timed alarms.

[U] https://dianne.skoll.ca/projects/remind/

